{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdYoudSfXw1ryo8YjDfy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Within a short span, Apple has entered home security with a new product line built with LG and Schneider Electric, Amazon has updated its smart home range with new AI-powered cameras, and ADT has agreed to be acquired by an OpenAI-backed holding company. Thrive Holdings announced on Thursday that it is buying ADT for $10 per share, about $7.6 billion in equity, in a deal ADT values at $15.3 billion in total enterprise value.\n\nApple and Amazon reached this market by building products. Thrive reached it by buying one of the established names in physical security. Thrive Holdings was spun out of Josh Kushner's Thrive Capital as a holding company, and it says it owns more than 75 businesses with the aim of holding them long-term and revitalizing them with AI. OpenAI, an investor and partner, provides those businesses with AI models, technology and forward-deployed engineers. ADT now joins that arrangement, and the press release says it \"will form the foundation of Thrive Holdings' smart home security business.\"\n\nThe details that would make the comparison with Apple and Amazon concrete are still missing. Neither ADT nor Thrive has said what AI-powered security products are coming. The companies have said only that they intend to invest and release new ones. ADT also already partners with both Apple and Google and is expected to continue, so its relationships with large platforms will carry on under its new owner even as Apple sells security products of its own.\n\nHow these approaches compare will depend on what Thrive and OpenAI's engineers actually ship from inside ADT, and so far there is no announced product or timeline to measure."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":849,"cache_read_input_tokens":3049,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":849},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"611c2f65-ce1a-4fdd-97bb-2cc127751ac9","uuid":"f36ae9dc-e5de-41f0-a23c-e89a7d5e968e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:28:36.407Z","request_id":"req_011CgdYouPp5TsKyii87LpGE"}
